<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">conjure-air</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Conjure Air Elemental</ansi> spell tears an air elemental from the
elemental plane and binds it to your command. Air elementals are the
fastest creatures a conjurer can call — blindingly quick, capable of
striking several times before a foe can land a counter. Their fragility
is their trade-off; what they lack in staying power they repay with
relentless aggression and an almost uncatchable evasion.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast conjure-air</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Neutral
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Manifestation
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 8
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> Staggering

<ansi fg="white-bold">Notes:</ansi>
  - No component is required to cast this spell.
  - Air elementals excel at evasion and high-speed harassment.
  - The elemental persists until destroyed or dismissed.
  - Scaling improves with your Charisma and Manifestation skill.
  - You cannot exceed your companion limit with this spell.

